 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Twice the speed means half the time, so it's relatively quick. Pop the volume up so you can follow along, and try focusing on one person's voice for a few minutes. It depends how you use it. For some people, it' like having a personal coach with them every workout. Then try picking one expert's voice to follow. Try to understand what they' saying first, before the next song starts. Great. It gets easier with time, too. Your brain gets used to the speed.",
